    "No physical audio-device deadline, converter latency, XRUN, audible quality or controller hardware compatibility proof.",
    "Headless egui frame time excludes a window-system compositor and physical display presentation; no Orca or human accessibility certification.",
    "Dense live control changes exercise implemented commands; no automation-lane editor exists.",
    "Long note capture exercises implemented MIDI composition; no general microphone or audio-file recording editor exists."
  ],
